From 7949758105151040e897f3c4a5d19cf7bb8f5ea2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: add generalized Merklix set reconciliation P2P protocol

Extend V2PeerProtocolHandler with depth-4 and depth-8 Merklix bucket
reconciliation (merklixsync, getmerklixbuck, merklixbuck, getshorttx,
shorttx), per-peer rate limiting, and full reconciliation unit tests in
v2_protocol_handler_tests.cpp.
